<template><div><el-form-item label="物料类型"><el-select :value="value.material_type" @input="$emit('input',{...value,material_type:$event})"><el-option label="生产件" value="production"/><el-option label="备件" value="spare"/></el-select></el-form-item><template v-if="value.material_type==='spare'"><ProcurementTerms/><el-row><el-col v-for="(options,k) in classes" :key="k" :span="8"><el-form-item :label="k.toUpperCase()"><el-select :value="value[k]" @input="$emit('input',{...value,[k]:$event})"><el-option v-for="v in options" :key="v" :label="v" :value="v"/></el-select></el-form-item></el-col></el-row><el-form-item label="分类依据"><el-input :value="value.reason" @input="$emit('input',{...value,reason:$event})" type="textarea" placeholder="ABC价值统计期间；VED设备关键性；FSN实际消耗依据。仅采购记录不能代表流动性。"/></el-form-item><p>ABC价值 × VED关键性矩阵；当前备件以FSN颜色标识（F蓝／S橙／N灰）。分类为人工评审，非自动分类。</p><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px"><template v-for="a in classes.abc"><div v-for="v in classes.ved" :key="a+v" style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #dce4ef">{{a}} / {{v}} <el-tag v-if="value.abc===a&&value.ved===v" :type="value.fsn==='F'?'':value.fsn==='S'?'warning':'info'">当前物料 · {{value.fsn}}</el-tag></div></template></div></template></div></template>
<script>import ProcurementTerms from "./ProcurementTerms.vue";export default {components:{ProcurementTerms},props:{value:{type:Object,required:true}},data:()=>({classes:{abc:['A','B','C'],ved:['V','E','D'],fsn:['F','S','N']}})};</script>
